@HostAddress = http://localhost:5080
@userId = 1

### Sign in first (Accounts/Http/Account.http → Login Account)

### List Trainer
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/showdown/trainers

### Get Trainer
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/showdown/trainers/{{userId}}

### SetPartner Trainer
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/showdown/me/partner
Content-Type: application/json
X-LivingDex: 1

{
  "partner": 6,
  "shiny": true
}
